FEATURE: minified-build
DATE: 2026-10-07
SCOPE: add a script that produces a minified copy of the library

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
AFFECTED PROJECTS
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

vUX library (this repository) is the only project changed. No library source
changed, so consumers (vGet, sketch-app, app.myinvitees.com) are unaffected
until they choose to point at dist/<version>/.

  - minify.sh      new; esbuild per-file minify into dist/<version>/
  - .gitignore     new; ignores dist/
  - README.md      new "Minified build" section
  - ChangeLog.md   one bullet under v4.0.0-beta Added

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
RESULT
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

JS: 722,024 bytes -> 281,262 bytes (62% smaller), 21 files, same layout.

--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
VERIFICATION
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All 12 example pages (autowriter, carousel, component, fontsplash, form,
listscroller, modal, resizer, skeleton, sketchpad, spa, timelinelist) were
loaded in headless Chromium twice: once served from the source tree, once from
the dist build with the examples placed beside it. Rendered DOM size and
console errors matched on every page. The only console errors were FontSplash
font-load messages, which appear identically on the source and include
the page's deliberate missing-font demo. Only page load was exercised; the
interactive controls were not clicked through.
